Measurement profile created from immutable grader mechanics and metadata-level static task/database statistics.
Implemented rolling-safe direct event modeling, prequential calibration, schedule geometry, circuit mixtures, correlation-aware aggregation, compact direct/residual models, and four-fold expanding replay selection.
Added all-table temporally censored relational features and within-cohort ranks, percentiles, z-scores, and leader gaps.
Kept the immutable kapso_evaluation directory unchanged; the registered evaluator remains kapso_evaluation/kapso_eval.py.
Corrected constructor-circuit accumulators to aggregate at race level before shifting, eliminating within-race teammate-label contamination discovered before the archived full run.
Rejected added trend, inactivity, schedule-posterior-component, and inferred-teammate features after the direct replay mean declined from 0.8954 to 0.8944.
Changed the direct L2 regularization from C=0.05 to C=0.01 after an internal expanding-fold sweep improved the comparable three-fold mean from 0.8954 to 0.8997 with lower dispersion; event logistic remains at the specified C=0.05.
Registered full run_0001 scored validation ROC AUC 0.9080468008. The replay-selected C=0.01 refinement was then evaluated as run_0005 and scored 0.9103940083 with average precision 0.7412376880, accuracy 0.8758503401, and F1 0.6635944700.
Technical difficulties: the first local shell command was rejected because it included rm -rf; rerunning without deletion worked. The first pipeline execution raised pandas MergeError for int64 versus nullable Int64 as-of keys; normalizing both join keys to int64 fixed it. An initial patch accidentally removed main.py while replacing it; it was immediately recreated with apply_patch. A review found constructor-circuit cumulative features advanced once per teammate row and could expose the first teammate's same-race label; aggregation at constructor-race level before shifting removed the contamination before archived evaluation. A widened trend/inactivity/teammate feature attempt reduced internal replay and was fully reverted. Full-evaluation stdout was block-buffered through tee, but the foreground process remained alive and the complete output was captured on disk.
